; The two `(exclusive-group …)`s in the manifest own the source COUNTS:
; a trigger needs exactly one of :every / :at, a track carries at most
; one of :expr / :pattern. All three records are source=sjon with spans;
; what a count cannot see (a non-positive :every, an empty :at, a track
; with (key …) children beside a source) stays a pacer diagnostic.
(transport :bpm 120)

(trigger :target radius :every 2b :at [4b 8b])

(trigger :target radius)

(track :target radius :expr (+ beat 0) :pattern [0 1])
